### Test Registrasi Siswa via Excel
### Endpoint: POST /api/v1/auth/register-bulk-excel-siswa?idKelas={id}
### Memerlukan autentikasi dengan role Admin
### IdRole di-hardcode = 3 (Santri)

@host = https://localhost:5001
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@idKelas = 1

### Upload Excel file untuk registrasi siswa
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-bulk-excel-siswa?idKelas={{idKelas}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary1234567890

------FormBoundary1234567890
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="siswa.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./siswa.xlsx
------FormBoundary1234567890--

###

### Test Registrasi Guru via Excel
### Endpoint: POST /api/v1/auth/register-bulk-excel-guru
### Memerlukan autentikasi dengan role Admin
### IdRole di-hardcode = 2 (Guru)

### Upload Excel file untuk registrasi guru
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-bulk-excel-guru
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary1234567890

------FormBoundary1234567890
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="guru.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./guru.xlsx
------FormBoundary1234567890--

